+            // THE ROW'S OWN PROMISE: w:cantSplit, made only where it can be kept.
+            //
+            // cantSplit means "this row does not break across a page". Written on every row it
+            // is a promise the engine cannot keep: a row that does not fit in what is left of
+            // the sheet has nowhere to go, so the renderer moves the whole row - and every row
