+            // boxes and it lays out ~170 pt, so 683.6 + 170 = 853.6 does not fit and the row
+            // jumps. flowTwOf() sums the w:before + w:line of what was actually emitted, which
+            // is the number the renderer lays out; the larger of the two is the row's real
